---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import Header from "../components/Header.astro";
import Footer from "../components/Footer.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="About Project KAI | Local-First AI Operating System"
  description="Project KAI is a local-first, human-controlled AI operating system for conversation, research, memory, content automation, governance, and paper-trading intelligence."
  canonicalPath="/about"
>
  <Header />

  <main id="main-content" class="page-main">
    <section class="page-hero">
      <div class="container">
        <p class="page-kicker">About Project KAI</p>
        <h1 class="page-title">A local-first AI operating system with authority kept visible.</h1>
        <p class="page-lede">
          Project KAI is the public home for KAI OS: specialized intelligence, persistent memory,
          research, automation, and paper-trading systems coordinated behind explicit policy and
          human control. It is not AGI, and it is not presented as unrestricted autonomy.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="page-section">
      <div class="container content-grid">
        <article class="content-card wide-card">
          <h2>Mission</h2>
          <p>
            The mission of Project KAI is to make KAI OS useful as an operating layer for research, creation, automation, digital business, and continuous improvement while keeping human oversight clear.
          </p>
        </article>

        <article class="content-card">
          <h2>Principles</h2>
          <p>
            Local-first processing, modular design, controlled execution, evidence before claims, practical output, and safety boundaries guide the platform.
          </p>
        </article>

        <article class="content-card">
          <h2>Positioning</h2>
          <p>
            KAI OS is not a generic chatbot. It is a governed operating layer that routes work toward specialized systems with different permissions and maturity.
          </p>
        </article>

        <article class="content-card wide-card">
          <h2>Current Focus</h2>
          <p>
            Local multilingual conversation, human-reviewed content production, memory and orchestration foundations, mature trading research, and controlled Alpaca Paper validation—without continuous or live-money trading.
          </p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <Footer />
</Layout>
